{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f2be2716b370c2857abea5eb1228bc2be7f3ca1821be82caa9b7281d8c29fd60", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n瑞希の準備はできたかな？　様子を見てみよう……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n不知道瑞希准备好了吗？去看看她的情况吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "e666e2cff730b7c260d1ce08b16657de3a1c00ebbd5bfce93d54f1be20598dc5", "ja": "ふっふっふっ……。あれ？　ちょっと違う。\nえっと……うふふ？　おほほ？　……うーん。", "zh": "呵呵呵……。咦？好像有点不对。\n呃……呵呵？哦呵呵？……嗯——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7434cec449f6e5e1669abcd8e9b576f19664a5e9e954cb6f6babc40c95944655", "ja": "お疲れ様、瑞希。\n今のは……笑い方の練習か？", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希。\n刚才那是在……练习笑法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "5293afbbe88e55222b77067a074d7022aa787330ec9ec679917ccaa6877d15f9", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}。\n半分正解です。テストなら三角です。", "zh": "早上好，{$P$}。\n答对了一半。如果是考试的话，只能得三角。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "10878c0d0f66b827310c41f16b70252d25831c05e56585afa021fcb4e83438d4", "ja": "正解は『かわいいワンピースを着るに相応しい、\n清楚で上品な振る舞いを練習していた』……です。", "zh": "正确答案是——“我在练习与可爱连衣裙相称的清纯优雅举止”……哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1005_p", "source_sha256": "401215b68e07ea00285a0f67f5484e936e8bb5c790969a9ac84e2b018cf8b05c", "ja": "なるほど。半分も合ってない気もするけど……。\nまあ、いいや。それで練習は順調か？", "zh": "原来如此。感觉连一半都没猜对……  \n不过，算了。那练习还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "b51505786218fb0210794e82dbb00c6eb2c6901f137deb70a7d73bd5e489c402", "ja": "いえ……いきなり行き詰っています。\n何回やっても、思うような清楚感が出せません。", "zh": "不是……一开始就陷入瓶颈了。\n不管尝试多少次，都无法呈现出理想的清纯感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "bf31dc38364cb6bd17a68b51ac13086f8da8eddaba7be9864a9d3c7cb83b8549", "ja": "もしかして、私には清楚の素質が……ない？\nガーン……これは困ったぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "难道我没有清纯气质的天分……？  \n咣当……这下麻烦了，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f2e6779707e7d8bb3d776e6476a0c29c44f2382aac4e64e9c36c6c1fa554b6ec", "ja": "素質というより、イメージの問題かもしれないな。\n瑞希はどんなことをイメージしたんだ？", "zh": "与其说是资质，不如说可能是形象的问题吧。瑞希想象的是什么样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "a72c3f79807f99f20cfb2f37a68490b6c0cba5f4e61454c53240f493859db82f", "ja": "そうですね……。えっと、儚さと透明感があって、\nでも、少しだけ不思議な印象を受ける……。……あっ。", "zh": "是啊……嗯，我觉得有种虚幻和通透的感觉，\n不过，又给人一种稍微有点不可思议的印象……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "2d0dd08f95438395129ad3d15d2d29b019c331fd35dff9f976b5de119a93a328", "ja": "{$P$}、わかりました。\n私の求める清楚なイメージ……。バッチリです。", "zh": "{$P$}，明白了。\n就是我所追求的那种清纯形象……非常完美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f387702dbd0db50e2314859d1600cfcb3fe54621b6152329f640ed7f4e8f0783", "ja": "おお、そうか！　あとはそれを表現するだけだけど……\nうまくできそうか？", "zh": "哦哦，这样啊！接下来只要把它表现出来就行了……你能顺利做到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "f5c0fc7d3c2b6129a75c2cc6af9a9755f4c0febcdffaf6c82d4d5ffa381dd5cf", "ja": "もちろんです。森の中で佇む少女、そして不穏な笑み。\n若干、姿は透けていますが……ドキドキするぞ。", "zh": "当然没问题。伫立在森林中的少女，以及诡异的微笑。\n虽然身影略微有些透明……但令人心跳加速呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1013_p", "source_sha256": "888ef3ecdabcecb956466556ae72362c005b2ecdb5b17f2b7c6ed24a343f9bbe", "ja": "ん？　それは……幽霊じゃないか？\nいや、確かに儚いし透明感はあるが……。", "zh": "嗯？那是……幽灵吧？\n不，确实给人一种虚幻又通透的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0343_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "7ee94382ba04a557f690d35b83c35bd46b33e7e2a09cf451a920b59df53db072", "ja": "きっと、気のせいです。{$P$}も\n見れば納得するはずです。……ふふふっ。", "zh": "一定是你看错了。{$P$}先生只要看过也一定会理解的。……呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
